{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLS0yMDE1L1RoZSUyMERhd25zJTIwSGVyZSUyMEFyZSUyMFF1aWV0JTIwJTI4MjAxNSUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"The Dawns Here Are Quiet","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/hPeYCHutYtsHibDiSDAfJ4SYedk.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dAHEASP8tI4SyZE979gxHFtMTLx.jpg","description":"It is late spring of 1942, and the Great Patriotic War is in full swing. A long way off from the front-line, at some God-forgotten junction, the Germans make an air landing operation in an attempt to get through to the Kirov railway and the White Sea - the Baltic Sea Canal. These aren't just ordinary paratroopers. This is a team of seasoned and highly trained infiltrators, the elite of the Waffen-SS, superhumans. The only thing in their way is an anti-aircraft artillery unit of corporal Vaskov and five young women in training. It may seem like a fight of local significance, but the countrys main strategic transportation artery is at stake. Can the corporal and his 'petite newbies' prevent Nazi sabotage and at what cost?  Television version: An extended version made out of four 45 minute episodes was released on Channel One Russia, on 9 May 2016. Available on PrimeVideo.\n\nReleased 30 Apr 2015 · Russia · Language: Russian · 111 min\nStudio: Star Media, Interfest, Real Dakota\n\nOn your server — Audio: Russian","releaseInfo":"2015","genres":["Drama","War","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.8","imdb_id":"tt4629032","moviedb_id":338517,"tmdbId":338517,"runtime":"111 min","cast":["Pyotr Fyodorov","Anastasiya Mikulchina","Evgenia Malakhova","Kristina Asmus","Sofia Lebedeva","Agniya Kuznetsova","Ekaterina Vilkova","Anatoliy Belyy"],"director":["Renat Davletyarov"],"writer":["Artem Vitkin","Yury Korotkov","Boris Vasilyev"],"released":"2015-04-30T00:00:00.000Z","country":"Russia","language":"Russian","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Renat Davletyarov","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1